{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>fast-paced, fun-to-play endless traffic racer</strong> with <strong>stylized pixel art visuals</strong>! Speed down a <strong>never-ending road filled with cars</strong>, dodge traffic with quick reflexes, and push yourself to beat your best distance. Combine <strong>unique power-ups</strong> like <strong>Ghost Mode, Magnet, Bomb, Shield, and Engine boosts</strong> to create exciting new strategies every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>achievements</strong>, collect <strong>daily rewards</strong>, and climb the <strong>global leaderboard</strong> to prove you\u2019re the ultimate driver. With <strong>customizable controls</strong> and special <strong>in-game events</strong>, the action never stops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea6 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Endless Racing:</strong> Quick, thrilling runs on a never-ending highway packed with cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Pixel Art:</strong> Retro-inspired visuals with a modern twist make every run a visual treat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combinable Power-Ups:</strong> Mix <strong>Ghost Mode, Magnet, Bomb, Shield, and Engine</strong> for unique gameplay strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Compete against players worldwide and show off your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> Unlock milestones as you improve your driving abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Rewards &amp; Events:</strong> Collect bonuses and take part in limited-time challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Controls:</strong> Adjust gameplay to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master:</strong> Quick to pick up, endlessly replayable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized for Everyone:</strong> Runs smoothly even on low-spec PCs.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992400?t=1759463892","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992400?t=1759463892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992400/c4064ef8a609c0b61ba521c35d736fec75e1177a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759463892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992400/c4064ef8a609c0b61ba521c35d736fec75e1177a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759463892","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>fast-paced, fun-to-play endless traffic racer</strong> with <strong>stylized pixel art visuals</strong>! Speed down a <strong>never-ending road filled with cars</strong>, dodge traffic with quick reflexes, and push yourself to beat your best distance. Combine <strong>unique power-ups</strong> like <strong>Ghost Mode, Magnet, Bomb, Shield, and Engine boosts</strong> to create exciting new strategies every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>achievements</strong>, collect <strong>daily rewards</strong>, and climb the <strong>global leaderboard</strong> to prove you\u2019re the ultimate driver. With <strong>customizable controls</strong> and special <strong>in-game events</strong>, the action never stops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea6 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Endless Racing:</strong> Quick, thrilling runs on a never-ending highway packed with cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Pixe